<title>USA: Triton Energy sells $400 mln in 2-part deal.</title>
<headline>Triton Energy sells $400 mln in 2-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Triton Energy Corp was priced on Monday, according to co-lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>It was also co-lead managed by Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Triton Energy is a oil and gas exploration and production company.</p>
<p>BORROWER TRITON ENERGY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 8.75 PCT   MATURITY 4/15/2002</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.942  FIRST 10/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 8.764 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 205 BPS    MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT 20</p>
<p>						  BASIS POINTS OVER U.S.</p>
<p>							  TREASURIES</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 4/15/2005</p>
